  "body_html": "<h1>prior_map_eval_of_hasIndependentTypePriors</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem prior_map_eval_of_hasIndependentTypePriors [Fintype I] [DecidableEq I] (A : BayesianSingleItemAuction I) [∀ i : I, IsProbabilityMeasure (A.typeMeasure i)] (h : A.HasIndependentTypePriors) (i : I) : A.prior.map (Function.eval i) = A.typeMeasure i</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>HasIndependentTypePriors</li>\n<li>productPrior_map_eval</li>\n</ul>",
